A '''Milk Bucket''' is a {{Common}} item that can be used to remove [[Potion]] effects or craft certain items.

== Obtaining ==
=== Trades ===
A '''Milk Bucket''' can be obtained in exchange for {{Coins|50}} in the [[Trades]] menu after unlocking {{Coll|Leather 2}}.

=== Buckets ===
A '''Milk Bucket''' can be obtained by filling up a {{Item|Bucket}} from a {{MobSprite|Cow}} or {{MobSprite|Mooshroom}}-based [[Mob]].

== Usage ==
=== Removing Potions ===
A '''Milk Bucket''' can be consumed to remove all the player's active [[Potion]] effects, including the effects of a {{Item|God Potion}}. Doing this will turn the '''Milk Bucket''' back into a {{Item|Bucket}}.

